### Infrastructure & Operational Demo Requests
### Base URLs
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@infraUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/infra
@infraShortUrl = {{baseUrl}}/infra
@infraSecret = change-this-to-a-secure-random-token
@superAdminToken = your_super_admin_sanctum_token_here
@regularUserToken = your_regular_user_sanctum_token_here

### ==================================================================
### 1. Scheduler Endpoints (/scheduler)
### ==================================================================

### 1.1 Trigger Scheduler with Static Header Key (POST)
POST {{infraUrl}}/scheduler
Accept: application/json
X-Infra-Key: {{infraSecret}}

### 1.2 Trigger Scheduler via short URL /infra (POST)
POST {{infraShortUrl}}/scheduler
Accept: application/json
X-Infra-Key: {{infraSecret}}

### 1.3 Trigger Scheduler with Super Admin Token (POST)
POST {{infraUrl}}/scheduler
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### ==================================================================
### 2. Queue Processing Endpoints (/queue)
### ==================================================================

### 2.1 Process Queue (Default: 1 job, stop when empty)
POST {{infraUrl}}/queue
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Infra-Key: {{infraSecret}}

{
    "connection": "redis",
    "queue": "default",
    "stop_when_empty": true,
    "max_jobs": 1
}

### 2.2 Process Queue with Webhooks (success, error, final)
POST {{infraUrl}}/queue
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Infra-Key: {{infraSecret}}

{
    "connection": "redis",
    "queue": "default",
    "stop_when_empty": true,
    "max_jobs": 1,
    "webhooks": {
        "success": {
            "url": "https://webhook.site/demo-success",
            "method": "POST",
            "headers": {
                "X-Custom-Header": "saas-worker",
                "Content-Type": "application/json"
            },
            "body": {
                "status": "success",
                "content": "Queue processed 1 job successfully"
            }
        },
        "error": {
            "url": "https://webhook.site/demo-error",
            "method": "POST",
            "headers": {
                "Content-Type": "application/json"
            },
            "body": {
                "status": "error",
                "content": "Queue worker encountered a failure"
            }
        },
        "final": {
            "url": "https://webhook.site/demo-final",
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
                "status": "final",
                "content": "Queue execution ended"
            }
        }
    }
}

### ==================================================================
### 3. Artisan Command Execution Endpoints (/artisan)
### ==================================================================

### 3.1 Execute Artisan Command (e.g. inspire)
POST {{infraUrl}}/artisan
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Infra-Key: {{infraSecret}}

{
    "command": "inspire"
}

### 3.2 Execute Artisan Command with Parameters and Webhooks
POST {{infraUrl}}/artisan
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Infra-Key: {{infraSecret}}

{
    "command": "subscriptions:check-cycles",
    "parameters": {
        "--tenant": "demo_tenant"
    },
    "webhooks": {
        "success": {
            "url": "https://webhook.site/command-success",
            "method": "POST",
            "headers": {
                "X-Api-Key": "my-secret-key"
            },
            "body": {
                "status": "success",
                "content": "Subscription cycle check completed successfully"
            }
        },
        "final": {
            "url": "https://webhook.site/command-final",
            "method": "POST"
        }
    }
}

### ==================================================================
### 4. Sad Paths & Security Obscurity (Strict 404 Response)
### ==================================================================

### 4.1 Sad Path: Queue endpoint without credentials (Expects 404 Not Found)
POST {{infraUrl}}/queue
Accept: application/json

### 4.2 Sad Path: Queue endpoint with invalid key (Expects 404 Not Found)
POST {{infraUrl}}/queue
Accept: application/json
X-Infra-Key: invalid-token

### 4.3 Sad Path: Artisan endpoint without credentials (Expects 404 Not Found)
POST {{infraUrl}}/artisan
Accept: application/json

### 4.4 Sad Path: Artisan endpoint with invalid key (Expects 404 Not Found)
POST {{infraUrl}}/artisan
Accept: application/json
X-Infra-Key: invalid-token

### 4.5 Sad Path: Artisan endpoint missing command parameter (Expects 422 Unprocessable)
POST {{infraUrl}}/artisan
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Infra-Key: {{infraSecret}}

{
}
